---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="kicker mono rv">
      <span class="rec"></span> PRODUCT ENGINEER &mdash; MARINE CORPS VETERAN &mdash; INDEPENDENT AI TOOL BUILDER
    </p>

    <h1 class="hero-title split" data-split>
      <span class="line">FROM CRAYONS</span>
      <span class="line lime">TO CODE<span class="cursor blink">_</span></span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-hook rv">
      Marine Corps logistics, Navy recruiting pipelines, and on-device AI have one thing in common:
      Andrew Robida &mdash; twelve years spent translating complexity into systems people can actually use,
      without a single computer science class.
    </p>

    <!-- departure-board dossier -->
    <div class="board mono rv" role="table" aria-label="Dossier">
      <div class="board-row board-head">
        <span>DOSSIER</span><span>A. ROBIDA // EST. 1986</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-row"><span>ROLE</span><span>PRODUCT ENGINEER &amp; SYSTEMS ARCHITECT</span></div>
      <div class="board-row"><span>SERVICE</span><span>US MARINE CORPS &mdash; 12 YRS &mdash; LOGISTICS</span></div>
      <div class="board-row"><span>STATUS</span><span class="lime">INDEPENDENT &mdash; AI / LOCAL-FIRST TOOLS</span></div>
      <div class="board-row"><span>BANNER</span><span>&ldquo;HELPFUL, NOT ADDICTIVE&rdquo;</span></div>
      <div class="board-row"><span>ROUTE</span><span>PARADE DECK &rarr; DEPLOYMENT PIPELINE</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="host-brief rv">
      <p class="mono brief-tag">&#9619; HOW THIS SITE WORKS</p>
      <p>
        This is an interview you conduct yourself. Below are <strong>eleven prompts</strong> &mdash;
        the ones you&rsquo;d ask if you sat down with him. Pick any, in any order,
        and Andrew answers in his own words.
      </p>
      <a href="#journey" class="cta mono">
        START WITH THE STORY <span class="cta-arrow">&darr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-ticker mono" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ticker-track">
      {Array(2).fill(0).map(() => (
        <span>
          USMC LOGISTICS &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; 60 CONTRACTS / $3M &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; GITHUB EST. 2016 &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; 200K+ SUBSCRIBER MIGRATION &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; 30+ DOMAINS SERVERLESS &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; LLMATE &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; SWIFT-PASS &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; DATA-SMITH &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp; HELPFUL NOT ADDICTIVE &nbsp;&#9642;&nbsp;
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-grid-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 9%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 9%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black, transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black, transparent 75%);
  }
  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .kicker {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--sage); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .rec {
    width: 9px; height: 9px;
    background: var(--lime);
    animation: recpulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes recpulse { 50% { opacity: 0.25; } }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 11.5vw, 9.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }
  .hero-title .line { display: block; }
  .hero-title .lime { color: var(--lime); }
  .cursor { font-weight: 400; }

  .hero-hook {
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--sage);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .board {
    max-width: 720px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 40%, transparent);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 1.4vw, 0.8rem);
  }
  .board-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 25%, transparent);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .board-row:not(.board-head):hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lime) 4%, transparent); }
  .board-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .board-row span {
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .board-row span:first-child {
    color: var(--sage);
    border-right: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 25%, transparent);
  }
  .board-head { background: var(--lime); }
  .board-head span { color: var(--ink) !important; font-weight: 600; border-color: var(--ink) !important; }

  .host-brief {
    max-width: 560px;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .brief-tag { color: var(--lime); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .host-brief p { color: var(--paper); margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .host-brief strong { color: var(--lime); font-weight: 600; }
  .cta {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--lime); color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-pop);
  }
  .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .cta-arrow { transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-pop); }
  .cta:hover .cta-arrow { transform: translateY(3px); }

  .hero-ticker {
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 30%, transparent);
    padding: 0.9rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--sage);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .ticker-track { display: inline-flex; animation: ticker 40s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes ticker { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ticker-track { animation: none; }
    .rec { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
